e with his own ups and downs at work, but thankfully, he has an ally: his senpai Shizuka, who happens to be a witch. Shizuka is always ready to lend a hand to those in need, but Misono thinks she should take better care of herself, since zipping around on a broomstick to run errands can be quite stressful. Is Misono’s over-solicitous concern for Shizuka driven by mere respect for this flustered witch, or could it be more? Let this magical romantic comedy cast its spell on you!","year":2018,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"safe","tags":["Romance","Drama","Fantasy","Slice of Life"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/60de2707-2a4a-4fa6-92fa-0b534898cd4d/6107bffd-abb9-48a4-9f4e-3064e9eec716.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ja","availableLanguages":["en","it","ru","pt-br","fr","id"],"lane":"manga","rating":8.82,"follows":18220,"listAt":"2026-10-25T12:57:10.860Z","chapters":[{"id":"b5fea0a8-9c68-4730-b975-5df8218d8ba6","number":"66","volume":"4","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":9,"createdAt":"2023-08-31T02:40:32+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"3cab74b4-bd4e-4919-af17-23e049cbd76a","number":"65","volume":"4","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":10,"createdAt":"2023-08-14T08:47:10+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"8d24cb4e-12b6-4d0c-be8f-b256c0814563","number":"64","volume":"4","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":8,"createdAt":"2023-07-19T06:43:56+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"3016d00f-700e-4b7d-8715-b6ad61145c14","number":"63","volume":"4","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":9,"createdAt":"2023-07-02T18:34:07+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"83904a01-b5df-4e9b-a3ba-e1bbd8a961d6","number":"62","volume":"4","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":7,"createdAt":"2023-06-29T01:53:57+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"54dc3346-eb96-4107-8689-8f412438932e","number":"61","volume":"4","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":9,"createdAt":"2023-05-22T05:55:21+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"9f9a95aa-662b-4e6b-ae0e-73805ddc1445","number":"60","volume":"4","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":8,"crea